{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2411","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2411/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2411/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2411/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2411","id":350392619,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNTAzOTI2MTk=","number":2411,"title":"unused-import is only consistently suppressed for typing.TYPE_CHECKING - not TYPE_CHECKING","user":{"login":"dlangeland","id":1868890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Njg4OTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1868890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland","html_url":"https://github.com/dlangeland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangeland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":297274515,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTcyNzQ1MTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/labels/Bug%20:beetle:","name":"Bug :beetle:","color":"ea9896","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2018-08-14T11:43:38Z","updated_at":"2018-08-16T10:22:26Z","closed_at":"2018-08-15T20:04:21Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi,\r\n\r\nI am seeing some inconsistent behavior when relying on type checking.\r\n\r\nIt appears to make a difference if import are guarded by typing.TYPE_CHECKING vs. just TYPE_CHECKING. The difference only comes into play when the imported module is referred to as Module vs. 'Module' - see the examples.\r\n\r\nGenerally we prefer the 'from typing import ...' approach as other things are used besides just TYPE_CHECKING.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n**unused-import is not emitted** - using typing.TYPE_CHECKING and 'Queue':\r\n```\r\nimport typing\r\n\r\nif typing.TYPE_CHECKING:\r\n    from queue import Queue\r\n\r\ndef a(b: 'Queue'):\r\n    print(b)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**unused-import is not emitted** - using TYPE_CHECKING and Queue:\r\n```\r\nfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\r\n\r\nif TYPE_CHECKING:\r\n    from queue import Queue\r\n\r\ndef a(b: Queue):\r\n    print(b)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**unused-import IS emitted** - using TYPE_CHECKING and 'Queue':\r\n```\r\nfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\r\n\r\nif TYPE_CHECKING:\r\n    from queue import Queue\r\n\r\n\r\ndef a(b: 'Queue'):\r\n    print(b)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Current behavior\r\nProtecting import with TYPE_CHECKING vs. typing.TYPE_CHECKING makes a difference.\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nUsing  TYPE_CHECKING or typing.TYPE_CHECKING should result in the same behavior.\r\n\r\n### pylint --version output\r\npylint 2.1.1\r\nastroid 2.0.4\r\nPython 3.6.6 (default, Jul 17 2018, 11:12:33)\r\n[GCC 6.3.0 20170516]\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2411/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}